### ============================================
### LOG ANALYSIS
### ============================================

### Analyze Logs by Batch ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/logs/analyze/{{batchId}}


### ============================================
### ERROR ANALYSIS
### ============================================

### Get Top N Errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/errors/top/{{batchId}}?n=10

### Get Top Errors by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/errors/top/{{batchId}}?n=5&category=NETWORK

### Get Top Errors by Category (SERVER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/errors/top/{{batchId}}?n=5&category=SERVER

### Get Top Errors by Category (DATABASE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/errors/top/{{batchId}}?n=5&category=DATABASE


### ============================================
### ERRORS BY DATE
### ============================================

### Get Errors by Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/errors/by-date/{{batchId}}?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-12-31T23:59:59Z

### Get Errors by Date with Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/errors/by-date/{{batchId}}?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-12-31T23:59:59Z&category=SERVER


### ============================================
### ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS
### ============================================

### Get All Root Causes
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/errors/root-cause/{{batchId}}

### Get Root Cause by Pattern ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/errors/root-cause/{{batchId}}?patternId={{patternId}}


### ============================================
### LOG ENTRY FILTERING
### ============================================

### Filter Entries - All Parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/filter/{{batchId}}?page=1&limit=50&errorCategory=SERVER&severity=HIGH

### Filter by Error Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/filter/{{batchId}}?errorCategory=NETWORK

### Filter by Severity
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/filter/{{batchId}}?severity=CRITICAL

### Filter by Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/filter/{{batchId}}?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-12-31T23:59:59Z

### Filter by User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/filter/{{batchId}}?userId=john@example.com

### Filter by Transaction ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/filter/{{batchId}}?transactionId=tx-123-456

### Pagination Example
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/filter/{{batchId}}?page=2&limit=10


### ============================================
### BATCH MANAGEMENT
### ============================================

### Get All Batches
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/batches


### ============================================
### ERROR CATEGORIES REFERENCE
### ============================================
### - NETWORK       : Network connectivity issues
### - VALIDATION    : Data validation errors
### - SERVER        : Internal server errors
### - DATABASE      : Database errors
### - AUTHENTICATION: Auth failures
### - AUTHORIZATION : Permission errors
### - TIMEOUT       : Timeout errors
### - RATE_LIMIT    : Rate limiting
### - NOT_FOUND     : Resource not found
### - BAD_REQUEST   : Bad request errors
### - UNKNOWN       : Uncategorized errors
###
### SEVERITY LEVELS
### ============================================
### - CRITICAL : Immediate action required
### - HIGH     : High priority
### - MEDIUM   : Moderate priority
### - LOW      : Low priority
###
### ============================================
### ANDROID/SURGIR APP - SPECIFIC TAGS
### ============================================
### The Android/SURGIR log parser recognizes these tags:
###
### - EEEWW         : Unknown/Internal code
### - VERIFY        : Verification status
### - AUTORIZATION  : JWT token information
### - CASA          : Property type (FAM/PRO)
### - INFO TASAS    : Rate variables (business type, installment)
### - Error Envió   : HTTP API errors (401, 400, etc.)
### - Estado de la Red: Network latency/speed
### - PRODUCTS      : Business products list
### - EXPENSES      : Business expenses
### - fragment_client: Customer/spouse info (birthdate, civil state, segment)
### - AGE           : Customer age calculation
### - Toast         : Android Toast warnings
### - error         : Generic errors
### - SYNC          : Sync status
### - INFO RULE GUARANTEE: Environment and office info
### - Product       : Product details
### - FlujocomponenteCamara: Camera component loading
### - ResponseRules  : Insurance rule engine response
### - codeselected   : Selected insurance code
### - BasicInsurance : Insurance selection
### - FormProposalFragment: Credit proposal form data
### - Endpoint       : API endpoint calls with status
### - FormProposalViewModel: Form errors and stack traces
### - ApiCustomer    : Customer API response
### - Tag getCustomer: Customer data from system
### - Respuesta phone: Phone contact data
### - Respuesta address: Address data
### - Lista de creditos: Credit/loan list
### - pulling json   : JSON data pull status
### - get Documentos Requeridos: Required documents for process
### - Id instancia de proceso: Process instance data
### - RESPONSE DATABASE: Database extraction response
###
### HTTP STATUS CODES IN ANDROID/SURGIR LOGS:
### ============================================
### - 401 : Unauthorized - Token expired or invalid
### - 400 : Bad Request - Malformed request message
### - 200 : Success
### - 500 : Internal Server Error
###
### COMMON ERRORS TO FILTER:
### ============================================
### Filter by tag: "Error Envió" - Get all API errors
### Filter by httpStatus: 401 - Get authentication errors
### Filter by message containing "NullPointerException" - Get Java crashes
### Filter by errorCategory: AUTHENTICATION - Get auth failures
### Filter by errorCategory: VALIDATION - Get validation errors
